{"4682690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ALPHA STORM", "steam_appid": 4682690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>High-Octane Arcade Combat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpha Storm</strong> is a high-octane, arcade third-person shooter. <br>- Use a super quick dash move around the map and avoid enemy attacks.  <br>- Switch between three weapon types, each with <strong>their</strong> own set of skills and abilities, to defeat a <strong>variety</strong> of enemy types. <br>- Use assist abilities for <strong>coordinated</strong> attacks.<br><br>Note: Please refer to this section and the included ReadMe file for gameplay features and bug information. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/a9bcd781401adc20a50e6897819db341.poster.avif?t=1779771518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/a9bcd781401adc20a50e6897819db341.webm?t=1779771518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/a9bcd781401adc20a50e6897819db341.mp4?t=1779771518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u>The drill is over. The fight for reality has begun</u></strong><br>What started as a routine tactical exercise has spiraled into a digital nightmare. A highly advanced, rogue combat simulation AI has evolved, sealing the exits and is attempting to rewrite your squad's consciousness into permanent data. Experience a cinematic Sci-Fi story and follow Rico’s squad into the heart of the action!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/8e5ea40accb2257a21978ada1cdad11d.poster.avif?t=1779771518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/8e5ea40accb2257a21978ada1cdad11d.webm?t=1779771518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/8e5ea40accb2257a21978ada1cdad11d.mp4?t=1779771518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong><u>Ether Energy!</u></strong><br>The simulation runs on <strong>Ether Energy</strong>, and so do you. Manage this vital resource to fuel your offensive capabilities: <br> - Use Ether Energy to fire off devestating attacks to dispatch hordes of enemies. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/b149229a28316175c1676a134c483a0e.poster.avif?t=1779771518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/b149229a28316175c1676a134c483a0e.webm?t=1779771518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/b149229a28316175c1676a134c483a0e.mp4?t=1779771518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><u>STORM </u></strong><u>ASSAULTS<strong>!!</strong></u><br>- Call on your squad members to even the odds using powerfull <strong>STORM ASSUALTS!!</strong> ( squad assist attacks )<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/6fb8ddee806ae7cc3a39b7bc68c8b2d3.poster.avif?t=1779771518\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682690/extras/6fb8ddee806ae7cc3a39b7bc68c8b2d3.webm?t=1779771518\" type=\"vid